 / 429); the deterministic floor P1-P11 all passed with zero blocking findings. Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before Submit.","timestamp":1785620188803098001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"FORCE_CLOSE: close gate(s) bypassed by user approval — no completion/signature attestation was signed. Reason: \"Change 1180 MERGED to main via Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 (CI green); commit 1a64cb27f7 reachable from origin/main. Plan-review attestation unsigned only because no LLM provider was available in this env (no Anthropic key; Gemini credits depleted); deterministic floor P1-P11 all PASS, zero blocking findings. Operator-directed land.\". Session: 1a64cb27f7.","timestamp":1785621159741162001}],"created_at":1785619916847962001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2b19eaf1-f5ab-479c-bf9c-09a681e69d0f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"4bbb-1621-4465-4d7f"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nRunning `uv` in this checkout generates a `uv.lock` at the repo root that shows up as an untracked file. rebar deliberately keeps core dependencies unpinned (`>=`), and `.github/dependabot.yml` states a `uv` ecosystem block should be added only \"if a uv.lock is ever committed\" — so the lockfile is a per-developer artifact that must not be tracked.\n\n## Approach\nAdd a `uv.lock` entry to `.gitignore` with an explanatory comment matching the file's existing commented style, placed alongside the other per-developer tooling ignore rules (e.g. `.serena/`, `.tokensave/`). No dependency-manifest change — core deps stay unpinned `>=` by design; this only stops an already-uncommitted artifact from appearing as untracked.\n\n## Scope\n- `.gitignore` — add a commented `uv.lock` ignore rule.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.gitignore` contains a `uv.lock` rule; verified by `git check-ignore uv.lock` printing `uv.lock` and exiting 0.\n- [ ] A stray root `uv.lock` no longer appears in `git status --porcelain`.\n- [ ] No other tracked files change; verified by `git diff --stat` on the change showing only `.gitignore`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":".gitignore","reason":"add a commented uv.lock ignore rule so the per-developer lockfile is not tracked"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","4bbb-1621-4465-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"f918c523-923b-428e-8bd5-d79d450f9397","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"856c-4282-53e0-4d77","ticket_type":"task","title":"Ignore per-developer uv.lock in .gitignore","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1ebddfc6-d35a-49f3-a70b-b3d99bad448f","e3fb527f-c8d3-4807-987b-17ddf6338b28","69c5422c-eec2-4d78-bd81-3f457d9266cd","3e2198de-ef22-497e-aa6f-875120713ba3","fd2854c9-d346-469e-9ada-21ee31ca1307","3a31c1b4-0b07-441f-b095-1ea146e0e3bc","2b19eaf1-f5ab-479c-bf9c-09a681e69d0f","f918c523-923b-428e-8bd5-d79d450f9397","9b2a69ca-cccb-4a33-a84f-86af6a1a63a7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659629569664001,"uuid":"f5c89eda-6043-4e1d-ae52-3a4b9a76de7f"}